_item_assets/steam/apps/3265000/extras_big/c8ad7bb954a4812bfe1c873bef626d60.avif?t=1731485613 width=800 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to shooting actions, there are various types of puzzles throughout the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265000/extras/d39d51930d3464deaa30bd48e064f11f.avif?t=1731485613\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265000/extras_big/d39d51930d3464deaa30bd48e064f11f.avif?t=1731485613 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can make different choices during the game, which will affect the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265000/extras/d5bd2c7f49a4576e2f3c4ce7e453a3f6.avif?t=1731485613\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265000/extras_big/d5bd2c7f49a4576e2f3c4ce7e453a3f6.avif?t=1731485613 width=800 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265000/extras/191d5fccf51cdefb41d61500565eecde.avif?t=1731485613\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265000/extras_big/191d5fccf51cdefb41d61500565eecde.avif?t=1731485613 width=800 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features choices that determine Roy's destiny, with multiple endings based on the truths uncovered and the decisions made along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265000/extras/c